      "hypothesis": "Electrides are characterized by a high proportion of electropositive alkali/alkaline\u2011earth sites and very low minimum electronegativity, combined with (a) a spacious lattice (high volume per atom), (b) few charge\u2011balanced oxidation\u2011state assignments (low total_assignment_count) indicating excess electrons, (c) overall tight average interstitial clearance (negative sampled_grid_clearance_statistics_A__mean), (d) heterogeneous void sizes (high sampled_grid_clearance_statistics_A__std), and (e) many candidate void centres (high candidate_count_before_output_limit).",
