        "void_connectivity_dimension \u2013 categorical metric (0D, 1D, 2D) describing the dimensionality of the interconnected void network.",
        "ELF_max_interstitial \u2013 maximum electron localisation function value within identified void regions.",
        "interstitial_band_energy \u2013 energy of the lowest interstitial\u2011derived electronic band relative to the Fermi level."
      ]
    },
