          "function": "structure_summary",
          "feature": "pauling_electronegativity__std",
          "physical_role": "Standard deviation of elemental electronegativities; a larger spread reflects strong contrast between electropositive donors and more electronegative partners, which promotes charge separation and localisation of interstitial electrons (supported by Li6P and sodalite electride studies)."
        },
